    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know... everyone says to \"reach out\" but it feels like such a cliche. it doesn't actually change the situation. the numbers don't change, the work doesn't get easier, and the feeling of being a failure just stays. it's like i'm stuck in this loop where no matter what i do, it's never enough to make things okay. it feels like there's no actual exit, just more of the same struggle forever.",
