      "content": "it’s just that everything is so permanent. the debt, the failures, the way people look at me. it feels like i’m just a broken machine that’s supposed to keep running but i’ve already stalled out. what’s the point of just \"getting through\" if the cycle just starts all over again tomorrow? it’s like being trapped in a room that’s slowly filling with water, and everyone is just telling me to learn how to breathe underwater instead of just letting me go.",
